      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "Some puzzles make sense but some a pure trial and error (talking to you ‘building a castle’). Seriously, what is the “right” way to build something when you are just given a pile of bricks?"
    },
    {
      "ref": "[R281]",
      "area": "content",
      "claim": "A parent reports frustration with no reset button for journeys, requiring game closure to restart.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "There is no button to reset it the journey there fire I have to close the game on the iPhone and go back to my main screen and tap on the game again and start over with the journey where I got stuck."
